  dayNumber: 1
  storyText: '- On the first day, we thought it was just a hoax until we saw our
    classmate getting dragged into the stairwell. \n- We barely made it back to the
    dorm room and slammed the door shut as the first wave of infected flooded the
    hallway. \n- While catching our breath, I checked the shelves and found some
    leftover supplies from last week.'
